#: templates/privacy.html:10
msgid "privacy policy title"
msgstr "Privacy policy"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy intro"
msgstr "This policy describes how the LM Toolbox app (org.lukemech.lmtoolbox), developed by Łukasz Błaszczyk, handles your data, and when it connects to the internet."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy data title"
msgstr "Data collected by the developer"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy data"
msgstr "None. The app has no account, no analytics, no advertising, no crash reporting and no tracking of any kind. Nothing you do in the app or create with it is sent to the developer, sold, or shared with third parties."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy network title"
msgstr "Internet access"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy network"
msgstr "The app uses the internet only for the features listed below. Each connection goes straight from your device to the named service which, like any server, sees your IP address and basic request details (such as the app's or tool's identifier)."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy network news"
msgstr "News feed: on the home screen, at most once every two hours, the app downloads short news about the app (and their images) from toolbox.lukemech.org. The request includes only your device's language, to pick the right translation."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy network rates"
msgstr "Currency Converter: downloads the daily reference exchange rates published by the European Central Bank (ecb.europa.eu). Nothing about you or your conversions is sent."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy network downloader"
msgstr "Media Downloader: when you give it a link, the app (using the open-source yt-dlp tool) connects to the website of that link to fetch the media you asked for, and saves it on your device. Those websites' own terms and privacy policies apply; the developer never sees your links or downloads. You are responsible for downloading only content you have the right to download."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy network play"
msgstr "Tools installed on demand: some tools are delivered as Google Play modules, downloaded by Google Play when you install them, under Google's privacy policy."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy network links"
msgstr "Links you open (e.g. from the news feed, the settings or a QR code) open in your browser or another app of your choice."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy network security"
msgstr "All of the app's own connections use encrypted HTTPS."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy device title"
msgstr "Permissions and data on your device"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy device location"
msgstr "Location: used only by the compass (and its widget), if you allow it, to show your altitude from GPS. It is processed on your device and never sent anywhere."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy device files"
msgstr "Files: photos, videos and other files you open, edit, convert or download are processed locally on your device (e.g. by the bundled ExifTool, FFmpeg and Python tools) and stay there."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy device notifications"
msgstr "Notifications: used only to show the progress of tasks running in the background, such as downloads and conversions."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy device backup"
msgstr "Settings: stored on your device. If you have Android backup turned on, they may be included in your device's backup to your Google account, under Google's terms."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy server title"
msgstr "This website"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy server"
msgstr "toolbox.lukemech.org uses no cookies, analytics or trackers. Like any web server, it may briefly keep technical logs (IP address, time and requested address) for its operation and security; they are not used to identify anyone and are not shared."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy use title"
msgstr "Use of the app"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy use"
msgstr "The app is provided free of charge, \"as is\", without any warranty; it is currently in testing and may contain bugs. Use its tools in accordance with the law and the rights of others, including copyright and the terms of the websites you download from. The bundled open-source components are covered by their own licenses, listed in the app's settings."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy deletion title"
msgstr "Deleting your data"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy deletion"
msgstr "Since all data stays on your device, you can delete it at any time by clearing the app's data or uninstalling it. Files you saved to your device's storage stay until you delete them."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy children title"
msgstr "Children"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy children"
msgstr "The app is not directed at children and knowingly collects no data from anyone, including children."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy changes title"
msgstr "Changes to this policy"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy changes"
msgstr "If the app changes how it handles data, this page will be updated before or together with that version, and the date below will change."

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy contact title"
msgstr "Contact"

#: templates/privacy.html
msgid "privacy contact"
msgstr "Questions about this policy or the app:"

